// P3G.4 (derived-and-linking.md DV3.1, DV3.3, DV3.5, DV3.7, DV1.5; external-references.md ER1.1,
// ER X2): the Derived feature's dialog. Document A "Block source" (the 50 × 30 × 25 block,
// "Sketch 2" a 20 × 10 rectangle, "Mate connector 1" at the top-face centre; V1, in the folder
// "Linked parts") and B "Block derived" ("Part Studio 1" with "Mate connector 1" at
// (0, 0, 100); "Plate") (`derived setup`).
// 01 the icon rail's Insert hovered (a Part Studio's Insert makes a Derived feature).
// 02 Derived 1's dialog on the source picker: Current document | Other documents; this document
//    ("Main") with its version graph button; its other Part Studio "Plate" (follows the tab).
// 03 Other documents: the search field and the locations.
// 04 the folder "Linked parts": Block source (V1).
// 05 Block source opened at its newest version, "V1": its Part Studio "Block".
// 06 its version graph (Main not selectable for another document, V1, Start).
// 07 back to the list; "Block" hovered.
// 08 Block picked: the source card "Block · Block source · V1" with the link icon and Change;
//    Derive: Part Studio (everything); Locations empty (the origin); Base origin; Include mate
//    connectors off, Include properties on. The block shows where it is in A (x 0..50).
// 09 Part Studio unticked: the source's Part 1, Sketch 1, Sketch 2 and Mate connector 1, each
//    with its box; Part 1 ticked.
// 10 ✓: "Derived 1" in the Feature list with the chevron and the plain link icon; the Parts
//    list has "Part 1"; mass 37 500 mm³.
// 11 the link icon's tooltip "Linked document: Block source › Block (V1)".
// 12 the chevron opened: its child "Part 1" with its eye.
// 13 Derived 1's menu: Open linked document (Block source (V1)), Update linked document…, Pin
//    reference.
// 14 Open linked document: Block source at V1, read-only, its tab "Block" active; Back.
// 15 A edited (depth 40) and versioned V2 (`derived edit`): the blue update badge on Derived 1
//    and on the tab.
// 16 the badge clicked: the Reference manager: Block source "V1 ⇒ V2" with Update all.
// 17 Update all: 50·30·40 = 60 000 mm³, the icon plain again.
// 18 the rail's Insert again, Block source › Block picked: refused (DV3.7) with the red toast
//    "Block is derived already in Part Studio 1 by Derived 1: a Part Studio can be derived only
//    once in a Part Studio"; the new feature waits for a source.
// 19 ✕: nothing added (Features: Derived 1 only).
